000002  *>****************************************************************
000003  *>                       Employee   Entry                        *
000004  *>                                                               *
000005  *>                      This is in three passes namely :-        *
000006  *>                      1. Primary Data incl. name & address etc.*
000007  *>                      2. Earn/Ded & Cost.                      *
000008  *>                      3. Rate Data.                            *
000009  *>                      4. Emp History data entry/amend          *
000010  *>                          from pyupdhis                        *
000011  *>                                                               *
000012  *>                      Each can be selected or                  *
000013  *>                          options 1 & 2 as menu option 4  or.  *
000014  *>                                  1, 2, 3 or 4.                *
000015  *>                                                               *
000016  *>                  MANUAL UPDATE NEEDED.                        *
000017  *>                                                               *
000018  *>  Option 4 only run if emp not had a pay run <<<<<<<<<<    NEEDS EXTRA CODING
000019  *>    This program sets up Emp-Search-Name from Emp-Name         *
000020  *>                                                               *
000021  *>****************************************************************
000022  *>
000023   identification          division.
000024  *>================================
000025  *>
000026        program-id.       py010.
