000035  *>                      This is in three passes namely :-
000036  *>                      1. Primary Data included name & address etc.
000037  *>                      2. Earn/Ded & Cost.
000038  *>                      3. Rate Data.
000039  *>                      4. Update Employee History.
000040  *>
000041  *>                      Each can be selected or
000042  *>                          options 1 & 2 as menu option 4  or.
