000083  *> Changes:
000084  *> 20/09/2025 vbc - 1.0.00 Created - starting. Prior to testing.
000085  *>                         After testing version will be set to v3.3.
000086  *>                         WARNING: You MUST set the terminal program to be 80
000087  *>                         cols wide and MORE than 27 lines deep and this is to
000088  *>                         allow for the some of the extra lines beyond 24 to
000089  *>                         be used as areas for the warning or error messages
000090  *>                         to be displayed. 26 lines is the minimum.
000091  *>                         This procedure must be applied at all times when
000092  *>                         running Payroll.
000093  *>                         For almost all terminal programs, can be achieved
000094  *>                         by pulling the left and bottom edges of the terminal
000095  *>                         screen with the mouse and holding right button and
000096  *>                         pulling until the correct number is displayed, and
000097  *>                         doing so, one at a time or pulling bottom right
000098  *>                         corner.
000099  *>
000100  *> 30/10/2025 vbc -        Still working on file rec layouts (ws)+ selects (sel)
000101  *>                         & fd's (fd).
000102  *> 05/11/2025 vbc -        Adding more SS for data input or display and menus.
000103  *>                         Some of which may well go into another program.
