000690  *>
000691   procedure division using WS-Calling-Data  *> ACAS
000692                            WS-System-Record *> ACAS
000693                            To-Day           *> ACAS
000694                            File-Defs.       *> ACAS
000695  *>
000696   aa000-Main                  section.
000697  *>**********************************
000698  *> Force Esc, PgUp, PgDown, PrtSC to be detected
000699       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_EXCEPTIONS" to "Y".
000700       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_ESC" to "Y".
000701       move     current-Date to WSE-Date-block.
000702  *>
000703       perform  forever
000704                accept   WS-Env-Lines   from lines
000705                if       WS-Env-Lines < 28
000706                         display  SY010    at 0101 with erase eos
000707                         accept   WS-Reply at 0133
000708                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
000709                         exit perform cycle
000710                end-if
000711                accept   WS-Env-Columns from Columns
000712                if       WS-Env-Columns < 80
GnuCOBOL 3.2.0          py010.cbl                                                     Thu Mar 26 2026 00:37:20  Page 0044

LINE    .....................................................SOURCE.....................................................

000713                         display  SY013    at 0101 with erase eos
000714                         accept   WS-Reply at 0130
000715                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
000716                         exit perform cycle
000717                end-if
000718       end-perform.
000719  *>
000720  *> Set up error message areas on screen
000721  *>
000722       subtract 2 from WS-Env-Lines giving WS-22-Lines.
000723       subtract 1 from WS-Env-Lines giving WS-23-Lines.
000724       move     WS-Env-Lines to WS-Lines.
000725  *>
000726  *> Pre setup params for acept_numeric routine
000727  *>
000728       move     zeros to AN-Error-Code
000729                         AN-Return-Code.
000730       SET      AN-FG-IS-Green    to TRUE.
000731       SET      AN-BG-IS-Black    to TRUE.
000732       SET      AN-FG2-IS-Cyan    to TRUE.
000733       SET      AN-Mode-IS-Update to TRUE.  *> could be AN-MODE-IS-NO-UPDATE to
000734  *>                                            TRUE on first use.
000735       move     1 to RRN.
000736       open     i-o  PY-Param1-File.     *> i-o Will NOT create a file
000737       if       PY-PR1-Status not = "00"      *> Does not exist yet so back to menu and let user run create
000738                display  PY139 at line WS-22-Lines col 1 foreground-color 4
000739                display  PY140 at line WS-23-Lines col 1 foreground-color 4
000740                display  SY003 at line WS-Lines col 1 foreground-color 2
000741                accept   Menu-Reply at line WS-Lines col 53
000742                close    PY-Param1-File
000743                goback
000744       else
